                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Do you know the days when you were sitting on the couch playing games like Smash Bros. with your friends on the couch?\n\nI do remember these days and this game brought these memories back. Whether victory or defeat, fun and entertainment is in the foreground of Super Dashmatch.\nThe gameplay is easy to learn because there are not that much Buttons to press but mastering this game can be challenging because of the excellent arenas and the strategies you can use to bring down your enemy.\nThe extraordinary and ever-changing arenas provide a lot of variety in the gameplay and make every game unique and exciting even for experienced players.\n\nI highly recommend to use a gamepad for the game. It allows a for a better handling of your character as the keyboard.\n\nWhether in online-multiplayer or in couch-mode this game was a lot of fun and I am looking forward to a growing community that is as excited about this game as me. \n\nSo roll on and dash as long as you can challenge your friends and turn them into foes for a few funny sessions in Super Dashmatch.\n\nI think this game is a successful project/product and I can only recommend it.\n\n",
